              "text": "<system-reminder>\nThis is an automated message providing context about the user's environment.\nThe user has just initiated a new connection via the [Letta Code CLI client](https://docs.letta.com/letta-code/index.md).\n\n## Device Information\n- **Local time**: Wednesday, March 11, 2026 at 04:41 PM PDT\n- **Device type**: macOS\n- **Letta Code version**: 0.18.0\n- **Current working directory**: /Users/cameron/letta/crap\n- **Git repository**: No\n</system-reminder>",
